				367,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind/Desktop): Enhance Mountain integration with advanced synchronization and storage capabilities\n\nThis commit strengthens the Wind-Mountain integration layer by adding robust event handling for advanced synchronization and preparing the storage service for encrypted storage and quota management.\n\nKey additions:\n- **Advanced Sync Event Handling**: Added comprehensive Mountain event listeners for document synchronization, UI state updates, and performance metrics with retry logic and error handling\n- **Connection Verification**: Implemented Mountain connection status verification via Tauri's `invoke` API to ensure reliable backend communication\n- **Storage Service Foundation**: Extended TauriStorageService with encryption key support, storage quota tracking (100MB default), and current usage monitoring\n- **Event Routing**: Added event emission to Wind services for processing Mountain-sent synchronization data\n\nThese changes support the ongoing multi-agent coordination effort by providing reliable real-time synchronization channels between Wind and Mountain, while laying the groundwork for secure storage management with quota enforcement.",
			"SHA": "b0523b8627552febc964af495fa7b1132ff83f43"
		}
